{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aFeatures of this game\u226b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime-style \u00d7 Japanese-style \u00d7 3D action</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed to be recommended for action game beginners!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Casual difficulty (difficulty can be changed)</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>  Difficulty is divided into four levels: &quot;Easy,&quot; &quot;Normal,&quot; &quot;Hard,&quot; and &quot;Aragaburu-kami&quot; (Very Hard).</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aPlay time\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 - 6 hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aCostumes\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dress-up elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A total of 6 types, including existing outfits (one of which is a costume variation)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/07455979d4cd1e2021fc0e97da1ee3d7.avif?t=1771942119\" width=1080 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/7897ff6c41d7a24ad24c5842d2a6a81f.avif?t=1771942119\" width=1080 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aStory\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the far reaches of Mizuho, beyond the outskirts of Takakumo City, stands the towering Mount Kumokami.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, a mysterious phenomenon known as Kamimadoi has caused a strange structure to suddenly appear atop this mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This structure is called the Nabari-no-Miya, and whenever it emerges, hordes of monsters descend upon the nearby villages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the master hidden deep within the Nabari-no-Miya is defeated, the structure vanishes, and the monsters fade with it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For generations, the prestigious Itsutsuno family of Takakumo City has bravely entered the Nabari-no-Miya each time it appears, defeating its master to protect the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, the Nabari-no-Miya has appeared once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiho Itsutsuno, head of the Itsutsuno family, sets out to fulfill her duty and confront the darkness within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What fate awaits her within those cursed walls\u2026?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/682072077eceeefc7e06a7b63ffd63b4.avif?t=1771942119\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aActions\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a variety of dynamic moves \u2014 from standard attacks and devastating special moves to double jumps, dodges, and swift dashes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine these skills to conquer enemies and blaze your way through each stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main Actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Normal Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Chain up to 4 consecutive strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Special Move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Consume Spirit Energy to unleash a powerful attack that deals massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Jump Slam Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Create a shockwave on impact, damaging enemies in a wide area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Double Jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Leap once more in mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Dodge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Evade enemy attacks with a brief moment of invincibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Dash</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u2192Move faster than normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/39b3ed8d1fbbc1ae7dd720f27dbadd12.poster.avif?t=1771942119\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/39b3ed8d1fbbc1ae7dd720f27dbadd12.webm?t=1771942119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/39b3ed8d1fbbc1ae7dd720f27dbadd12.mp4?t=1771942119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aCharacters\u226b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Chiho Itsutsuno</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The head of the prestigious Itsutsuno family in Takakumo City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s bold, confident, and occasionally a bit reckless \u2014 but she also carries the pride and responsibility of her noble lineage, earning the respect and affection of the townsfolk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/d19af87e545c2a031f10487513aeb2d0.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Sophia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl clad in elegant, European-style clothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She appears before Chiho as she ventures toward the Nabari-no-Miya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/b34f32716266565b9356dd89cb25e086.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Ushiromaru</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A female merchant who frequently appears within the Nabari-no-Miya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s said she hides her face because of her shy nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She offers Chiho assistance in exchange for gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/88d441004a6232d83d3cb92616f2e4a6.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Sakura Yoshino</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A girl born in the land of Hinomoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She possesses deer-like ears, antlers, and a tail \u2014 along with physical abilities far beyond those of ordinary people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/7c7cabe0424c37b51dbef4c49ad7bb87.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Kumakaya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was the king of a country that once opposed the Okimi in Hinomoto.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He was known as an unrivaled brave warrior, and sometimes personally led the front lines to defeat the Okimi's army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, he was assassinated by a subordinate who fell victim to an enemy plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is said that the blood of a god ran strong in his veins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/7d7db9b701f1c08e69ae414a8fe5077f.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=627 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Himuka Itsutsuno</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chiho's father.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the previous &quot;Kamimadoi&quot;, he reportedly went to &quot;Nabarinomiya&quot; and resolved it,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but he never returned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His strength was immense, earning him the title of &quot;Kishin&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/extras/e0411e597bf6151627e8ae9ca8ce13c9.avif?t=1771942119\" width=900 height=628 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505260?t=1771942119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771942119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/133634ed9c8c28cbb2f2936eed38f34e5102c296/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771942119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505260/133634ed9c8c28cbb2f2936eed38f34e5102c296/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771942119","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"A swimsuit costume with a lot of skin exposure is prepared for the female protagonist."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u226aFeatures of this game\u226b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anime-style \u00d7 Japanese-style \u00d7 3D action</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple controls</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b